{"message":"The best choice for maximizing your referral bonus with an approximately $30,000 deposit is **Navy Blue Business Checking**. You would earn **$100** if your partner opens the account and deposits at least **$5,000 within 90 days**. The $30,000 funding amount meets that requirement.

True Blue could pay $350 and Beige $500, but they require deposits of $50,000 and $100,000 respectively, so they would not qualify based on the expected funding.

Your referral also requires at least 60 days of Rho-Bank checking history. General restrictions apply: your partner must be a new Rho-Bank customer, the business must have a different primary owner from any existing Rho-Bank business account, the qualifying deposit must be new money, and only one promotion can be used. I verified your identity and logged the verification; I have not submitted a referral."}
